 "captions": [
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 1.0,
   "text": "My neighbor is a ~KILLER~…"
  },
  {
   "start": 1.0,
   "end": 2.5,
   "text": "…and I'm *NEXT.*"
  },
  {
   "start": 2.62,
   "end": 3.5,
   "text": "Here's how it happened…"
  },
  {
   "start": 4.2,
   "end": 7.4,
   "text": "Quiet street. Nothing ever happened."
  },
  {
   "start": 7.5,
   "end": 10.9,
   "text": "Then *HE* moved in next door."
  },
  {
   "start": 11.0,
   "end": 13.0,
   "text": "Mr. Gray."
  },
  {
   "start": 13.1,
   "end": 16.4,
   "text": "He watched me. Every. Single. Day."
  },
  {
   "start": 16.5,
   "end": 19.4,
   "text": "The new neighbor *never* blinked."
  },
  {
   "start": 19.5,
   "end": 21.9,
   "text": "Not. Once."
  },
  {
   "start": 22.1,
   "end": 25.9,
   "text": "That night I couldn't sleep."
  },
  {
   "start": 26.0,
   "end": 27.9,
   "text": "A light. In his *basement.*"
  },
  {
   "start": 28.0,
   "end": 31.9,
   "text": "So I snuck over…"
  },
  {
   "start": 32.0,
   "end": 33.9,
   "text": "and looked inside."
  },
  {
   "start": 34.1,
   "end": 36.9,
   "text": "He was dragging something…"
  },
  {
   "start": 37.0,
   "end": 38.9,
   "text": "Something *heavy.*"
  },
  {
   "start": 39.0,
   "end": 41.9,
   "text": "*MISSING.* All of them."
  },
  {
   "start": 42.0,
   "end": 43.9,
   "text": "And a *shovel.*"
  },
  {
   "start": 44.0,
   "end": 45.9,
   "text": "My heart stopped."
  },
  {
   "start": 48.2,
   "end": 51.9,
   "text": "Then he stopped too."
  },
  {
   "start": 52.0,
   "end": 53.2,
   "text": "*HE SAW ME.*"
  },
  {
   "start": 53.25,
   "end": 56.9,
   "text": "~RUN.~"
  },
  {
   "start": 57.0,
   "end": 58.9,
   "text": "His light went out."
  },
  {
   "start": 59.1,
   "end": 60.9,
   "text": "I made it home…"
  },
  {
   "start": 61.0,
   "end": 62.9,
   "text": "I was safe. Right?"
  },
  {
   "start": 63.2,
   "end": 64.9,
   "text": "*Wrong.*"
  },
  {
   "start": 65.7,
   "end": 66.9,
   "text": "Everything went black."
  },
  {
   "start": 67.1,
   "end": 68.9,
   "text": "When I woke up…"
  },
  {
   "start": 69.0,
   "end": 71.9,
   "text": "I was tied to a chair."
  },
  {
   "start": 72.0,
   "end": 73.9,
   "text": "In *HIS* basement."
  },
  {
   "start": 74.1,
   "end": 77.9,
   "text": "Then… *footsteps.*"
  },
  {
   "start": 78.0,
   "end": 81.9,
   "text": "Slow. Heavy. Coming closer."
  },
  {
   "start": 82.0,
   "end": 83.9,
   "text": "Wait… my *PHONE!*"
  },
  {
   "start": 84.0,
   "end": 87.9,
   "text": "Still in my pocket."
  },
  {
   "start": 88.0,
   "end": 89.9,
   "text": "I had one chance."
  },
  {
   "start": 90.0,
   "end": 93.9,
   "text": "9… 1… 1…"
  },
  {
   "start": 94.0,
   "end": 96.9,
   "text": "\"Please *HELP…*"
  },
  {
   "start": 97.0,
   "end": 98.9,
   "text": "…my neighbor…"
  },
  {
   "start": 99.0,
   "end": 100.9,
   "text": "*42 Elm Street.*\""
  },
  {
   "start": 101.0,
   "end": 102.9,
   "text": "He was right behind me."
  },
  {
   "start": 105.0,
   "end": 106.9,
   "text": "He reached for me…"
  },
  {
   "start": 107.0,
   "end": 108.9,
   "text": "Then… *SIRENS!*"
  },
  {
   "start": 109.0,
   "end": 110.4,
   "text": "\"*POLICE!* FREEZE!\""
  },
  {
   "start": 110.5,
   "end": 112.4,
   "text": "They got here *just in time.*"
  },
  {
   "start": 112.5,
   "end": 114.9,
   "text": "Mr. Gray was *arrested.*"
  },
  {
   "start": 115.1,
   "end": 120.0,
   "text": "Always trust your gut. 👀"
  }
 ],
